# Course certificate, on one landscape A4 page (Paper and Orientation: 842 × 595). A cream background and three
# concentric frames with four ornaments in the corners, all Page overlay with a negative Layer; the content
# centered, with the person's name as the protagonist; and at the bottom, two scanned signatures on either
# side of a seal with ribbons, slightly rotated (an Image with Rotate, which takes up the square that
# encloses it). The certificate number runs vertically in the left margin: a Page overlay rotated −90 degrees
# around its top left corner.
# The name of the school is written in lowercase and the rule of its style puts it in uppercase,
# spaced out (Case and Letter spacing).
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
